## Proposed Changes

### Komponen 1: Tab Approval untuk Semua User (B3 — paling kritikal)

#### [MODIFY] [EformAccessListPage.tsx](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/frontend/src/features/request-center/pages/EformAccessListPage.tsx)

**Masalah utama**: Line 30 `isManager = user?.role === 'MANAGER'` → tab "Pending Approvals" hanya muncul untuk role MANAGER. Padahal siapa saja bisa jadi approver.

**Fix**:
```diff
-    const isManager = user?.role === 'MANAGER';
-    const [tab, setTab] = useState<TabView>(isManager ? 'pending-approvals' : 'my-requests');
+    const hasPendingApprovals = pendingApprovals.length > 0;
+    const [tab, setTab] = useState<TabView>('my-requests');
```

Tab "Pending Approvals" tampil jika `hasPendingApprovals || loadingPending`:
```diff
-            {isManager && (
+            {(hasPendingApprovals || loadingPending) && (
                 <div className="flex gap-2 ...">
```

**Problem**: `pendingApprovals` belum ada saat `useState` init. Solusi: pakai `useEffect` untuk auto-switch tab ke pending jika ada data.

